#. module: bf_contact_absence_autoreply
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_contact_absence_autoreply.field_bf_absence_house_message__tone
msgid ""
"\"I reply more slowly\" announces a delay, \"I am out of the office\" announces an absence. The first holds even when you end up replying, which is the most common case.\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ Neither text agrees in gender: Odoo does not carry a person's gender, and a house message goes out under anybody's name."
msgstr ""

